<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 40.03 to 6883.90, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.26 to 411.57, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share up $0.23.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1279 to 1223.</p>
<p>Volume was 571,264,770 compared with 440,381,990 Monday.</p>
